    <briefdescription>
<para>Provide an iterator that walks defs, giving both the memory access, and the current pointer location, updating the pointer location as it changes due to phi node translation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This iterator, while somewhat specialized, is what most clients actually want when walking upwards through <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_s_s_a" kindref="compound">MemorySSA</ref> def chains. It takes a pair of &lt;<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_access" kindref="compound">MemoryAccess</ref>,<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_location" kindref="compound">MemoryLocation</ref>&gt;, and walks defs, properly translating the memory location through phi nodes for the user. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
